{"id":"wb-7-906","name":"大同观音堂","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"大同观音堂","text":"大同观音堂位于山西省大同市云冈区城西7.5公里的同云公路北边的一座小山岗上，1996年被列为山西省文物保护单位，2013年被列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。\n观音堂始建于辽代，现存的建筑为清顺治八年（1651年）重建。现存影壁、戏台、正殿（观音堂）、三真殿等建筑。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E5%90%8C%E8%A7%82%E9%9F%B3%E5%A0%82","revisionId":87831026,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=87831026","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/aba56363dc409b3b416be64f.jpg","title":"大同观音堂正殿中心观音菩萨造像群.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%A4%A7%E5%90%8C%E8%A7%82%E9%9F%B3%E5%A0%82%E6%AD%A3%E6%AE%BF%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83%E8%A7%82%E9%9F%B3%E8%8F%A9%E8%90%A8%E9%80%A0%E5%83%8F%E7%BE%A4.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2f/%E5%A4%A7%E5%90%8C%E8%A7%82%E9%9F%B3%E5%A0%82%E6%AD%A3%E6%AE%BF%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83%E8%A7%82%E9%9F%B3%E8%8F%A9%E8%90%A8%E9%80%A0%E5%83%8F%E7%BE%A4.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Patrick20242023","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"大同观音堂正殿中心观音菩萨造像群","width":320,"height":240}}